<title>UK: First Olsen Tankers appoints new chairman.</title>
<headline>First Olsen Tankers appoints new chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Olsen Tankers Ltd said Monday it has appointed former Citibank global shipping division chief John Newbold as chairman.</p>
<p>Previous chairman Robert Rice will remain as a board member, the Oslo-listed tanker operator added.</p>
</text>
